.TH CHIMERA-SHELL 1
.SH NAME
chimera-shell \- native Chimera command interpreter
.SH DESCRIPTION
Chimera Shell provides a native command dispatch layer with compatibility dialects for POSIX, Bash, Zsh, Dash, Ksh, Csh, Tcsh, Fish, PowerShell, Cmd, Nushell, Elvish, Xonsh, and Yash. Native commands are documented in section 1.
